10 REM BASIC-58 LED SOS EXAMPLE
11 REM SOS sequence Morse code S = three short flashes, O = three long flashes, S = three short flashes
12 REM 250 ms for a short flash, 750 ms for a long flash, and 250 ms between flashes.
13 REM

20 @SER CONNECT COM10

30 REM S - THREE SHORT FLASHES
40 @SER LED 18 ON
50 @DELAY 250
60 @SER LED 18 OFF
70 @DELAY 250
80 @SER LED 18 ON
90 @DELAY 250
100 @SER LED 18 OFF
110 @DELAY 250
120 @SER LED 18 ON
130 @DELAY 250
140 @SER LED 18 OFF

150 REM LETTER GAP
160 @DELAY 750

170 REM O - THREE LONG FLASHES
180 @SER LED 18 ON
190 @DELAY 750
200 @SER LED 18 OFF
210 @DELAY 250
220 @SER LED 18 ON
230 @DELAY 750
240 @SER LED 18 OFF
250 @DELAY 250
260 @SER LED 18 ON
270 @DELAY 750
280 @SER LED 18 OFF

290 REM LETTER GAP
300 @DELAY 750

310 REM S - THREE SHORT FLASHES
320 @SER LED 18 ON
330 @DELAY 250
340 @SER LED 18 OFF
350 @DELAY 250
360 @SER LED 18 ON
370 @DELAY 250
380 @SER LED 18 OFF
390 @DELAY 250
400 @SER LED 18 ON
410 @DELAY 250
420 @SER LED 18 OFF

430 @SER DISCONNECT
440 PRINT "SOS COMPLETE"
450 END
